        <ol start="2" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">For solid waste delivered to the Northside Landfill, the charge shall be:</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <table border="1" class="Table" style="background:white; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; margin-left:21.75pt">
